{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1028406001:1":{"text":"フンフン、ここ……見てください、大勢の人が通った痕跡があります！","source_cn":"这里、这里……快看，有很多人走过的痕迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D4608455BFBBD8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028406002:1":{"text":"こんなにたくさんの足跡が……ロンロンの言う通り、ここに部隊が留まっていたようですね。","source_cn":"这么多脚印……满满说得没错，看起来像是有一支队伍在这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD103E477FB1CCFC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028406003:1":{"text":"この足跡を辿れば、採集部隊を見つけられるんじゃないですか？","source_cn":"我们跟着脚印应该就能找到这些人了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55745542E8A79B2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028406004:1":{"text":"それはもちろん……きゃっ、気をつけて！足跡を踏んじゃダメよ！","source_cn":"那是当然……哎呀，细心点，不要破坏了这些脚印！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC96362601379245B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}